        "email": "30616+vilts@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-11-20T11:15:39Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): a Home button and a start page with the recent projects\n\nThe top band has a Home button left of Donate. It shows a start page in\nplace of the dock: the recent projects (the #662 list, newest first, a\ngone file greyed as missing), then Open project, New project and Back to\nthe project. A click on a project queues OpenRecent, so the unsaved\nchanges prompt is Open's. The page remembers the doc_version it opened\nover and closes when the document changes. It shows at a start with no\nfile on the command line. The version label stays the rightmost toolbar\nitem.\n\nThe glyph is Tabler's home outline (MIT), with its SVG master and notice.\nThe site icon mirror takes home.png, the act-report.png that #1696 left\nout, and the current LICENSES text.\n\nFixes #2384\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
